  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the beef and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the beef broth and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato puree and stir to combine.",
    "Stir in the Greek yogurt, salt, black pepper, red pepper flakes, and nutmeg. ",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and top with additional cilantro, if desired.",
    "Bake in a preheated oven at 375°F (190°C) for 20-25 minutes, or until the flavors have melded together and the top is golden brown, about 20-25 minutes.",
    "Let the dish rest for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
